  "title": "Genitiv — Showing Possession",
  "explanation": "Genitiv shows possession or belonging (\"of the...\"). Articles change: **der → des, die → der, das → des, die (plural) → der**. Masculine and neuter nouns also add **-s** or **-es**. In everyday spoken German, *von* + Dativ often replaces Genitiv.",
  "examples": [
    { "de": "das Auto des Mannes", "en": "the man's car" },
    { "de": "die Farbe der Blumen", "en": "the color of the flowers" },
    { "de": "das Haus meiner Eltern", "en": "my parents' house" }
  ],
